The cases of the commands suite for {{.ID}} (ADR-061 decision 5). Each obligation reads
its file beside this one: paths.json, the paths the row registers; run.json, the cases
of each command and their outcomes; cancel.json, the cases that run until they are
cancelled, each after its delay. run.json and cancel.json hold one case of the command
example, which its stub fails with "not implemented" until Run is written; add the
cases of each command it runs. paths.json is yours to write, so commands/paths fails
on its missing file until it lists the paths.
